# FINOVAX Frontend — Implementation Plan

A production-ready Web3 fintech prototype built with Next.js (App Router), simulating blockchain-backed invoice verification and financing with three roles: MSME, Lender, and Auditor.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Animation Library Choices**: The skill.md mentions Theatre.js and Anime.js. To ensure zero errors and a lean, stable build, I'll consolidate animations using **Framer Motion** (page transitions, pulse/glow effects, timeline) and **GSAP** (fraud alert shakes). This avoids compatibility issues and keeps the bundle manageable while delivering the same visual impact.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **React Three Fiber**: The spec mentions R3F for immersive widgets. I'll include a simple animated 3D blockchain visualization on the Lender dashboard to satisfy this requirement without heavy complexity.

> [!NOTE]
> **MetaMask**: Will use `ethers.js` v6 for wallet connection. The connection is display-only (shows address in navbar) since there's no real blockchain interaction yet.

