### Mock Data Layer (`src/lib/mock/`)

#### [NEW] `mockInvoices.ts`
- `Invoice` interface with strict typing
- 6 sample invoices across all statuses
- In-memory array with push/update helpers

#### [NEW] `mockLedger.ts`
- Ledger entries mapped by invoice hash
- `simulateLedgerLookup(hash)` — 1.2s delay, returns `{ exists, financedBy, txHash }`

#### [NEW] `mockUsers.ts`
- Demo users for MSME, Lender, Auditor roles

#### [NEW] `mockStats.ts`
- Auditor dashboard stats: totalVolume, fraudAttemptsBlocked, activeMSMEs, totalInvoices
- Audit timeline events array

---

### API Layer (`src/lib/`)

#### [NEW] `api.ts`
- Mock API functions for all 6 endpoints
- `setTimeout` delays (600–1400ms) for realistic latency
- Returns Promise-wrapped mock data

#### [NEW] `utils.ts`
- `generateSHA256(content)` using Web Crypto API
- `generateTxHash()` — creates `0xFINO` + random hex
- `formatCurrency()`, `formatDate()` helpers

